<%--
============================================================
MEMBER   : IT26101136 - [Name]
MODULE   : Shared UI
FILE     : empty-state.jspf
WHAT IT DOES (simple words): Shows the shared empty state block.
REAL-LIFE EXAMPLE: Shared signs help everyone find their way around the school.
OOP USED : Not applicable (shared presentation)
CRUD     : Displays existing data; does not save records
============================================================
--%>
<%-- This block shows empty state. The including page controller supplies this block through model attributes. --%>
<section class="ds-empty-state" role="status"><span class="ds-empty-icon" aria-hidden="true">✦</span><h2><c:out value="${emptyTitle}" default="Nothing here yet" /></h2><p><c:out value="${emptyMessage}" default="New items will appear here when they are available." /></p></section>
